{"words": [{"text": "أَلَمْ", "translation": "Did not"}, {"text": "تَرَ", "translation": "you see"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "[towards]"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "the one who"}, {"text": "حَآجَّ", "translation": "argued"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ", "translation": "(with) Ibrahim"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "concerning"}, {"text": "رَبِّهِۦٓ", "translation": "his Lord"}, {"text": "أَنْ", "translation": "because"}, {"text": "ءَاتَىٰهُ", "translation": "gave him"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُلْكَ", "translation": "the kingdom"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "Said"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "رَبِّىَ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "(is) the One Who"}, {"text": "يُحْىِۦ", "translation": "grants life"}, {"text": "وَيُمِيتُ", "translation": "and causes death"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "أَنَا۠", "translation": "I"}, {"text": "أُحْىِۦ", "translation": "give life"}, {"text": "وَأُمِيتُ ۖ", "translation": "and cause death"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "Said"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّ", "translation": "[Then] indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَأْتِى", "translation": "brings up"}, {"text": "بِٱلشَّمْسِ", "translation": "the sun"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَشْرِقِ", "translation": "the east"}, {"text": "فَأْتِ", "translation": "so you bring"}, {"text": "بِهَا", "translation": "it"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَغْرِبِ", "translation": "the west"}, {"text": "فَبُهِتَ", "translation": "So became dumbfounded"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "the one who"}, {"text": "كَفَرَ ۗ", "translation": "disbelieved"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "and Allah"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(does) not"}, {"text": "يَهْدِى", "translation": "guide"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَوْمَ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "(who are) [the] wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "Have you not considered the one who argued with Abraham about his Lord [merely] because Allāh had given him kingship? When Abraham said, \"My Lord is the one who gives life and causes death,\" he said, \"I give life and cause death.\" Abraham said, \"Indeed, Allāh brings up the sun from the east, so bring it up from the west.\" So the disbeliever was overwhelmed [by astonishment], and Allāh does not guide the wrongdoing people."}